  "description": "All-in-one auth component (login, register, change password, forgot/reset password, email verification + resend) with an opt-in Cloudflare Turnstile widget and declarative optional fields (first/last name, phone, legal consent, profile type). Headless core + hooks you wire to your own backend — no credentials or auth server ships with this component. React, Svelte, Vue, Angular and vanilla adapters, each with headless/tailwind/shadcn/vanilla presentations.",
